      480   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      481        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1.1
      482        B-export AT ROW 1 COL 21
      483        B-import AT ROW 1 COL 31
      484        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 82
      485        B-dir AT ROW 2.43 COL 81.3
